%S A397309 38,558,9158,151838,2520008,41828238,694291958,11524317758,
%T A397309 191288283638,3175130080008,52702919636438,874798092883358,
%U A397309 14520480242926358,241020583150395438,4000619850742680008,66404947581467424638,1102233460767045774758,18295603660314665834958
%N A397309 Number of perfect matchings of the 5 X 2n grid graph embedded on the Klein bottle.
%C A397309 The characteristic polynomial x^4 - 19*x^3 + 41*x^2 - 19*x + 1 is palindromic. Using y = x + 1/x, it reduces to y^2 - 19*y + 39, with roots (19 +- sqrt(205))/2. The dominant root is approximately 16.599.
%C A397309 Part of a family: for m = 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7 the characteristic polynomials are all palindromic. See A398567 (m=3) and A398672 (m=4).
%H A397309 Jean Lauro Muller, <a href="/A397309/b397309.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..30</a>
%H A397309 Jean Lauro Muller, <a href="/A397309/a397309.py.txt">Python program for computing the sequence</a>
%H A397309 <a href="/index/Rec#order_04">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (19,-41,19,-1).
%F A397309 a(n) = 19*a(n-1) - 41*a(n-2) + 19*a(n-3) - a(n-4) for n >= 5, with a(1) = 38, a(2) = 558, a(3) = 9158, a(4) = 151838.
%F A397309 G.f.: 2*x*(19 - 82*x + 57*x^2 - 4*x^3)/(1 - 19*x + 41*x^2 - 19*x^3 + x^4).
%e A397309 For n=1, the 5 X 2 grid on the Klein bottle has a(1) = 38 perfect matchings (multigraph convention).
%t A397309 LinearRecurrence[{19,-41,19,-1},{38, 558, 9158, 151838},18] (* _Stefano Spezia_, Aug 20 2026 *)
